// [App Data Access During Agency.note] search in ssTEA source files for a reference to this file.
//
   =================================================================================================
   Execution considerations for Events: parameters provided to the Event function when it is called.
   =================================================================================================
   Discussing Events: there is an API configuration, and there is the moment when Agency is granted.
   This is the Agency side: when an event function is called, parameters provided are about Agency
   known by the ssTEA event data, and a pointer to data that was established during the init state.
//
   The DB_TRUSTED_APP choice affects only the App's access to a copy of the actual ssTEA event data.
